      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Result: booked_count = 5 = confirmed bookings. No lost update, no over-booking (READ COMMITTED + one atomic UPDATE).\nThe DB CHECK (booked_count <= capacity) is the last safety net.\nSame order booked twice at once: unique index on order_id -> second gets 409 ORDER_ALREADY_BOOKED.\nTwo cancels at once: guarded UPDATE ... WHERE status = 'CONFIRMED' -> the seat is released only once.",
      "originalText": "Result: booked_count = 5 = confirmed bookings. No lost update, no over-booking (READ COMMITTED + one atomic UPDATE).\nThe DB CHECK (booked_count <= capacity) is the last safety net.\nSame order booked twice at once: unique index on order_id -> second gets 409 ORDER_ALREADY_BOOKED.\nTwo cancels at once: guarded UPDATE ... WHERE status = 'CONFIRMED' -> the seat is released only once.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
